{"input_path": "/mnt/c/Users/25840/Desktop/ocr-scan/ocr_json_app/out/peipu/pages/page03.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 1241, "height": 1754, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：根据题意，依次分析两个命题：", "block_bbox": [113, 160, 544, 189], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[113.0, 160.0], [544.0, 160.0], [544.0, 189.0], [113.0, 189.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "对于①，若对任意 $ a > b $，都有 $ M(a) \\supset M(b) $，即 $ M(a) \\supseteq M(b) $且 $ M(a) \\neq M(b) $，", "block_bbox": [106, 210, 868, 239], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 210.0], [868.0, 210.0], [868.0, 239.0], [106.0, 239.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "用反证法分析：", "block_bbox": [106, 258, 259, 286], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 258.0], [259.0, 258.0], [259.0, 286.0], [106.0, 286.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "任取 $ a > b $，假设 $ g(a) \\geq g(b) $，", "block_bbox": [106, 308, 405, 336], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 308.0], [405.0, 308.0], [405.0, 336.0], [106.0, 336.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "则对于任意的 $ x \\in M(a) $，有 $ f(x) > g(a) \\geq g(b) $，即 $ x \\in M(b) $，", "block_bbox": [105, 356, 706, 384], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 356.0], [706.0, 356.0], [706.0, 384.0], [105.0, 384.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故 $ M(a) \\subseteq M(b) $，", "block_bbox": [108, 405, 272, 433], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 405.0], [272.0, 405.0], [272.0, 433.0], [108.0, 433.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "又由 $ M(a) \\supset M(b) $，则必有 $ M(a) = M(b) $，与已知 $ M(a) \\supset M(b) $矛盾，", "block_bbox": [106, 454, 774, 482], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 454.0], [774.0, 454.0], [774.0, 482.0], [106.0, 482.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故必有 $ g(a)g(b) $，故 $ y=g(x) $严格减，①正确；", "block_bbox": [106, 502, 570, 532], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 502.0], [570.0, 502.0], [570.0, 532.0], [106.0, 532.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "对于②，举出反例， $ f(x)=1 $， $ g(x)=-x^{2} $，令t=1，", "block_bbox": [106, 551, 637, 580], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 551.0], [637.0, 551.0], [637.0, 580.0], [106.0, 580.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "对于任意的$b$，有$g(b) = -b^2 \\leq 0 < 1$，故$M(b) = \\{x | 1 > -b^2\\} = R$，恒成立，", "block_bbox": [106, 599, 855, 627], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 599.0], [855.0, 599.0], [855.0, 627.0], [106.0, 627.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "取 $ i=1,\\ M(b+1)=R=M(b) $，但 $ g(x)=-x^{2} $，不是周期函数，②是假命题；", "block_bbox": [106, 648, 873, 677], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 648.0], [873.0, 648.0], [873.0, 677.0], [106.0, 677.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "综合可得：①是真命题，②是假命题.", "block_bbox": [105, 697, 485, 726], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 697.0], [485.0, 697.0], [485.0, 726.0], [105.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故选：B.", "block_bbox": [107, 746, 206, 773], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 746.0], [206.0, 746.0], [206.0, 773.0], [107.0, 773.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "根据题意，由反证法结合函数单调性的对应分析 $ ^{①} $，举出反例分析 $ ^{②} $，综合可得答案.", "block_bbox": [105, 794, 945, 822], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 794.0], [945.0, 794.0], [945.0, 822.0], [105.0, 822.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题考查抽象函数的单调性、周期性的判断，注意函数单调性、周期性的定义，属于中档题.", "block_bbox": [106, 843, 1001, 872], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 843.0], [1001.0, 843.0], [1001.0, 872.0], [106.0, 872.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、填空题：本题共12小题，共54分。", "block_bbox": [106, 892, 499, 921], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 892.0], [499.0, 892.0], [499.0, 921.0], [106.0, 921.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 已知集合 $ A = \\left[-1,1\\right] $， $ B = \\left[0,2\\right] $，则 $ A \\cup B = $___．", "block_bbox": [106, 941, 614, 970], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 941.0], [614.0, 941.0], [614.0, 970.0], [106.0, 970.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】 $ [-1,2] $", "block_bbox": [115, 990, 267, 1020], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[115.0, 990.0], [267.0, 990.0], [267.0, 1020.0], [115.0, 1020.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：集合 $ A = \\left[-1,1\\right] $， $ B = \\left[0,2\\right] $，", "block_bbox": [114, 1038, 513, 1068], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[114.0, 1038.0], [513.0, 1038.0], [513.0, 1068.0], [114.0, 1068.0]]}, {"block_label": "inline_formula", "block_content": " $$  则 A\\cup B=[-1,2]. $$ ", "block_bbox": [121, 1088, 286, 1116], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 1088.0], [286.0, 1088.0], [286.0, 1116.0], [121.0, 1116.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故答案为： $ [-1,2] $.", "block_bbox": [107, 1136, 295, 1165], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1136.0], [295.0, 1136.0], [295.0, 1165.0], [107.0, 1165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "结合并集的定义，即可求解.", "block_bbox": [106, 1184, 387, 1212], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1184.0], [387.0, 1184.0], [387.0, 1212.0], [106.0, 1212.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题主要考查并集的运算，属于基础题.", "block_bbox": [106, 1233, 499, 1261], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1233.0], [499.0, 1233.0], [499.0, 1261.0], [106.0, 1261.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6. 不等式  $ |x - 1| < |x - 3| $ 的解集为 ___．", "block_bbox": [105, 1283, 506, 1311], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 1283.0], [506.0, 1283.0], [506.0, 1311.0], [105.0, 1311.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】 $ \\{x|x<2\\} $", "block_bbox": [115, 1331, 296, 1360], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[115.0, 1331.0], [296.0, 1331.0], [296.0, 1360.0], [115.0, 1360.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：因为 $ |x-1|<|x-3| $，", "block_bbox": [114, 1380, 458, 1408], "block_id": 25, "block_order": 26, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[114.0, 1380.0], [458.0, 1380.0], [458.0, 1408.0], [114.0, 1408.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "所以两边同时平方可得： $ x^{2}-2x+1<x^{2}-6x+9 $", "block_bbox": [106, 1428, 615, 1455], "block_id": 26, "block_order": 27, "group_id": 26, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1428.0], [615.0, 1428.0], [615.0, 1455.0], [106.0, 1455.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "所以4x<8，即x<2，", "block_bbox": [107, 1478, 330, 1504], "block_id": 27, "block_order": 28, "group_id": 27, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1478.0], [330.0, 1478.0], [330.0, 1504.0], [107.0, 1504.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "所以原不等式的解集为 $ \\{x|x<2\\} $.", "block_bbox": [107, 1526, 431, 1554], "block_id": 28, "block_order": 29, "group_id": 28, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1526.0], [431.0, 1526.0], [431.0, 1554.0], [107.0, 1554.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故答案为： $ \\{x|x<2\\} $.", "block_bbox": [107, 1576, 321, 1603], "block_id": 29, "block_order": 30, "group_id": 29, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1576.0], [321.0, 1576.0], [321.0, 1603.0], [107.0, 1603.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "第3页，共19页", "block_bbox": [545, 1656, 695, 1680], "block_id": 30, "block_order": null, "group_id": 30, "block_polygon_points": [[545.0, 1656.0], [695.0, 1656.0], [695.0, 1680.0], [545.0, 1680.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8191079497337341, "coordinate": [113, 160, 544, 189], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[113.0, 160.0], [544.0, 160.0], [544.0, 189.0], [113.0, 189.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.778062105178833, "coordinate": [106, 210, 868, 239], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 210.0], [868.0, 210.0], [868.0, 239.0], [106.0, 239.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.42497387528419495, "coordinate": [290, 212, 348, 235], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[290.0, 212.0], [290.0, 234.0], [347.0, 234.0], [347.0, 212.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.37505286931991577, "coordinate": [413, 212, 540, 238], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[413.0, 212.0], [540.0, 212.0], [540.0, 238.0], [413.0, 238.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.6136993169784546, "coordinate": [733, 212, 861, 237], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[733.0, 212.0], [861.0, 212.0], [861.0, 237.0], [733.0, 237.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7674605250358582, "coordinate": [106, 258, 259, 286], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 258.0], [259.0, 258.0], [259.0, 286.0], [106.0, 286.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8011298775672913